arStrings.szText:
Once per Cast, damaging enemies draws on Tal Rasha's power, triggering a {c_important}Mastery{/c} Skill, each element has a {c_number}[Affix."Static Value 0"]{/c} second Cooldown:
{icon:bullet,1.2} {c_important}Frost{/c} Skills trigger {c_important}Blizzard{/c}
{icon:bullet,1.2} {c_important}Pyromancy{/c} Skills trigger {c_important}Meteor{/c}
{icon:bullet,1.2} {c_important}Shock{/c} Skills trigger {c_important}Ball Lightning{/c}
